# Repo Routing

**Entry points:** `AGENTS.md` (zone map) · `Documentation/README.md` (canonical docs) · `docs/CURSOR-AGENT-HANDBOOK.md` (workflow/CI).

**Zones:** `apps/api/` (Go) · `apps/rpg-tracker/`, `apps/nutri-log/`, `apps/mental-health/` (frontends) · `packages/*` (shared — coordinate cross-cutting changes).

**Skills:** `.cursor/skills/<domain>/<skill>/SKILL.md` · index `.cursor/skills/skills.index.json` · validate with `pnpm validate:skills`.

**Guides:** operational runbooks in `docs/guides/`.
